id: elemental-adaptation
name: Elemental Adaptation
order: 8
# (1) The Resisted Element, chosen as it is gained.
choose: elementalProfile
resistedElement: true
description: >
  You are particularly suited to an environment with an elemental extreme as one of its core features.
text: >
  Elemental Adaptation: You are particularly suited to an environment with an elemental extreme as one of its core features.
  (1)-[Passive, Ruling]: Upon gaining this Bestial Trait, select a Profile with ‘Elemental’ in the name. This Profile is known as your ‘Resisted Element’.
  (2)-[Passive]: Halve all Damage you receive from Attacking Maneuvers of your Resisted Element.
  (3)-[Passive]: If your Resisted Element is a Connected Profile of a Battle Weather (see — Battle Weather), ignore the effects of that Battle Weather.
  (4)-[Passive]: If your Resisted Element is not a Connected Profile of a Battle Weather, increase your Racial Life Modifier by 2.

---

[passive]
# (2) The Damage of an attack of that Profile, halved (rounded down) as it is worked out for you (chat.mjs).
allow resisted.$choice;
# (3) Its header's `resistedElement`: the Battle Weather whose Connected Profile it is felt at Tier 0 - ignored (actor-character.mjs).
# (4)
if (!weatherConnected("$choice")) {
    racialLifeModifier += 2;
}
